```json
[
  {
    "node_id": "kebab-case-id",
    "title": "Imperative title of at most 120 characters",
    "owned_behavior": "The one behavior this unit owns",
    "repository_paths": ["repo/relative/path.py"],
    "acceptance_criteria": ["One testable criterion"],
    "failure_behavior": "What happens when this unit fails",
    "verification_commands": ["uv run pytest tests/unit/test_example.py"],
    "expected_evidence": "The evidence the checks produce",
    "prerequisites": ["prerequisite-node-id"],
    "requirement_ids": ["req-0123456789ab"],
    "finding_ids": ["find-0123456789ab"],
    "single_pr": true
  }
]
```

The host validates the complete tree and rejects the whole draft on any
schema, coverage, overlap, command, or dependency error.
